  "description": "Having cut down a 7 foot hedge because it was damaging the wall, I have placed a small, pre-fab, temporary metal bike shed at the side of the front garden. The bike shed will sit behind a trellis on which I will grow climbing plants. As a result, less of the front garden is now occupied by the shed than was occupied by the hedge, and the facade of the house is now visible from the street, whereas previously it was obscured by the hedge. The planning is for the small, temporary metal bike shed.",
